","g":"anything"},{"a":"وَٱلْأَمْرُ","t":"wal-amru","g":"and the Command"},{"a":"يَوْمَئِذٍۢ","t":"yawma-idhin","g":"that Day"},{"a":"لِّلَّهِ","t":"lillahi","g":"(will be) with Allah"}]}]}